stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> CREATED: requester creates

    CREATED --> ACCEPTED: courier accepts
    CREATED --> CANCELLED: requester cancels
    CREATED --> EXPIRED: acceptance time reached

    ACCEPTED --> COLLECTED: courier collects, with photo
    ACCEPTED --> CREATED: courier releases, or collection window ends

    COLLECTED --> DELIVERED: courier delivers, with photo
    COLLECTED --> ACKNOWLEDGED: requester acknowledges
    COLLECTED --> ESCALATED: requester escalates, or delivery deadline missed

    DELIVERED --> ACKNOWLEDGED: requester acknowledges
    DELIVERED --> ESCALATED: requester escalates
    DELIVERED --> UNACKNOWLEDGED: acknowledgement window ends

    ACKNOWLEDGED --> COMPLETED: 7 days after settlement
    UNACKNOWLEDGED --> COMPLETED: 7 days after settlement

    ESCALATED --> UNDER_REVIEW: admin review started
    ESCALATED --> COMPLETED: admin case resolved
    UNDER_REVIEW --> COMPLETED: admin case resolved

    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
